    <!-- Converted to BEAST 3 from beast.base/examples/legacy/testRandomLocalClock.xml.
         Proper priors (the same change is made in the BEAST 2 source):
           - hky.kappa: none (flat) -> LogNormal(M=1, S=1.25)
           - popSize: none (flat) -> LogNormal(M=0, S=8) in log space
           - rates: none (flat) -> LogNormal(M=0, S=8) in log space on each rate (IID)
         Changes made by the conversion:
           - SubtreeSlide is deprecated: replaced by kernel.BactrianSubtreeScale (the gaussian flag has no equivalent). It scales the gap above the moved subtree, so it needs no size in tree-height units (#214).
           - Upper bound 100 on rates is not kept; BEAST 3 keeps only positivity.
    -->


